Description: b1nix live medium and installer configuration
 What turns the b1nix root tree into a live medium and an installer: the
 initramfs boot script that runs the live session from the medium (boot=
 b1nix-live), the live session itself (an automatic root login and the
 b1nix-install launcher), the Calamares configuration and branding, and the
 script that installs Limine onto the target instead of Calamares' own
 bootloader module.
 .
 Installed on the live medium only; the installer removes it from the system
 it installs.
